# J1 · first look (gui-plan §3 item 10).
# launch → Orbit → your project → a dependency's package page → Start here,
# stop 1 → its page → ⌘. code → back ×3.
# Your project is `frontends/rust/fixtures/toml_pin` (pins toml 0.8.23 and
# calls toml::from_str); the dependency is toml 0.8.23 from the cargo
# registry cache. toml's tour (§8.2): from_str → Value → Table → Array →
# Index → Error. A detour (`else`) only keeps the journey going when the
# person could not do a step; the step still fails.
size 1440x900
start orbit

check orbit
  route orbit
  text "toml_pin" in reader

click orbit-project-*toml_pin else route package toml_pin
check your-project
  route package toml_pin
  text "toml-pin-fixture" in reader
  budget page-open <= 120ms

click "toml" after "Depends on" in reader else route package toml-0.8.23
check package
  route package toml-0.8.23
  text "toml" in reader
  line "0.8.23" in reader
  order "Start here" "from_str" "Value" "Table" "Array" "Index" "Error" in reader
  budget page-open <= 120ms

click "from_str" after "Start here" in reader else route symbol toml-0.8.23::src/de.rs::from_str
check stop-1
  route symbol toml-0.8.23::src/de.rs::from_str
  text "from_str" in reader
  budget page-open <= 120ms

key cmd-.
check code
  route symbol toml-0.8.23::src/de.rs::from_str view=code
  text "pub fn from_str<T>(s: &'_ str) -> Result<T, Error>" in reader

key cmd-[
check back-1
  route package toml-0.8.23
  focus "from_str" after "Start here" in reader

key cmd-[
check back-2
  route package toml_pin
  focus "toml" after "Depends on" in reader

key cmd-[
check back-3
  route orbit
  focus orbit-project-*toml_pin
  budget frame-p95 <= 8ms
